           <string>Destination callsign, with its SSID if it has one (G4ABC-7), CQ for everyone, or TG n for talkgroup n (a group call, relayed by a talkgroup gateway). With a gateway in Via, a callsign is reached through the network. The list contains callsigns heard by the selected DSD Demodulator.</string>
          </property>
          <property name="editable">
           <bool>true</bool>
          </property>
          <property name="insertPolicy">
           <enum>QComboBox::InsertPolicy::NoInsert</enum>
          </property>
         </widget>
