          </property>
         </widget>
        </item>
        <item row="3" column="1">
         <widget class="QComboBox" name="angel61Rate">
          <property name="toolTip">
           <string>Voice rate and constellation (the tier, ANGEL61.md 2.10): Auto follows the destination's rate request heard by a DSD Demodulator (tier 0 to CQ, a talkgroup, or until one is heard), or a tier forced, whatever is asked. V1 voice at the profile's rate; WB's tier 3 is Opus audio. A network call relayed goes at this tier or the call's, whichever is lower. Changed while transmitting (as Src, Dst and Via): the transmission ends and another starts with the change</string>
          </property>
          <item>
           <property name="text">
            <string>Auto</string>
           </property>
          </item>
          <item>
           <property name="text">
            <string>3.2k QPSK</string>
           </property>
          </item>
          <item>
           <property name="text">
            <string>6k 16-QAM</string>
           </property>
          </item>
         </widget>
